# 8ball: ask it a yes-or-no question and it answers Yes, No or Maybe.
# konfetti has no dice, so the answer comes from the question itself: the ring adds up its
# characters, the trail going west takes that sum (less one) modulo 3, and the pink at the
# end of the trail branches three ways. The same question always gets the same answer.
# No question at all gets Maybe.
#
#        Yes  <-----------------.
#        .--- Yes ...           |          (right: north, then east, then back west)
#   No ..|                      |
#   '--- No ... pink <-- mod 3 <-- pink --- green
#   Maybe ...... |                   |         |
#   |                              green      red      (the ring, counter-clockwise)
#   |                                |         |
#   '--- Maybe ...        origin   black --- orange
#
# Rows 2400 apart, joined by one strip at each bend; strips in a row lie end to end.
black     1000     0   # IN:     sum c        (c is -1 at the end of the question)
orange    2200     0   # DUP:    sum c c
red       2200  1200   # PUSH 1: sum c c 1
green     2200  2400   # ADD:    sum c c+1    (0 at the end)
pink      1000  2400   # BRANCH: >0 turn left to green, 0 straight on, out of the ring
green     1000  1200   # ADD:    sum+c        (the first time round there is no sum yet: nothing happens)
green     -200  2400   # ADD:    t = sum-1    (-1 for no question at all)
red      -1200  2400
red      -2200  2400
red      -3200  2400   # PUSH 3: t 3
purple   -4200  2400   # DIVMOD: t/3 r        (r = t mod 3, one of 0 1 2)
yellow   -5200  2400   # SWAP:   r t/3
brown    -6200  2400   # DROP:   r
red      -7200  2400   # PUSH 1: r 1
cyan     -8200  2400   # SUB:    r-1          (one of -1 0 1)
pink     -9200  2400   # BRANCH: 0 straight on to No, >0 left to Maybe, <0 right to Yes
red     -10200  2400
red     -11200  2400
red     -12200  2400
orange  -13200  2400
orange  -14200  2400
blue    -15200  2400
orange  -16200  2400
blue    -17200  2400
yellow  -18200  2400
cyan    -19200  2400
white   -20200  2400   # writes N
red     -21200  2400
red     -22200  2400
red     -23200  2400
orange  -24200  2400
orange  -24200  3600
green   -24200  4800
